roduction_draft.tex\\\\n    word_budget: 550  # from 669, -18%\\\\n    action: trim\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      保留所有核心内容但精简表述：\\\\n      (1) Hook: violation 数据不变\\\\n      (2) Gap: 合并 prompt/grammar/posthoc/training 4 段为 2 段更紧凑的对比\\\\n      (3) Method: 保持 OntoCoDec 描述但删减细节（Worker 不展开 entity registry 工作原理）\\\\n      (4) Contributions: 从 4 条压缩为 3 条（合并 C2+C3 为一条：framework + decidability taxonomy）\\\\n      不含 fig1_overview（图移入 Method §3）\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§2 Background\\\\\\\"\\\\n    file: section2_background.tex\\\\n    word_budget: 250  # from 564, -56%\\\\n    action: heavy_trim\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      大幅压缩，只保留后续正文需要的 notation 定义和 problem statement：\\\\n      (1) §2.1 IE Ontology Structure: 保留 O=(E,R,σ) 定义 + type-valid 定义 + \\\\n          constraint tightness 定义（1 句 + 1 个公式）。删除 SciERC/DocRED 具体数字\\\\n          （这些在 Experiments 中自然出现）\\\\n      (2) §2.2 Grammar-Constrained Decoding: 压缩为 2-3 句（cite XGrammar+Outlines，\\\\n          点明 CFG 限制——不能做 cross-field semantic constraints）\\\\n      (3) §2.3 Problem Statement: 保留 2 条 desiderata（structural + type validity），\\\\n          保留 prefix-decidability 关键 insight（1 句）\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§3 Method\\\\\\\"\\\\n    file: section3_method_draft.tex\\\\n    word_budget: 1100  # from 1578, -30%\\\\n    action: trim\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      核心贡献，保留技术细节但精简表述：\\\\n      (1) §3.1 Problem Formulation: 保留 eq:output-schema + eq:type-valid + violation 定义，\\\\n          但删减解释性文字（公式自解释）\\\\n      (2) §3.2 Grammar Layer: 保留 JSON Schema→XGrammar→M_g 的编译流程，\\\\n          删减 XGrammar 实现细节（读者可 cite 原文）\\\\n      (3) §3.3 Semantic Layer: 完整保留 entity registry + position detection + dynamic masking，\\\\n          这是核心新贡献\\\\n      (4) §3.4 Layer Interaction: 保留 enabling dependency + grammar-first invariant，\\\\n          但精简为 1 段（不需要完整的 conjunction 公式——Composition section 有）\\\\n      (5) §3.5 Decoding Strategies: 保留 S1 描述（3-4 句），S2 压缩为 1 句 +\\\\n          \\\\\\\"details in Appendix A\\\\\\\"\\\\n      图 fig1_overview 放在 Method 开头\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§4 Constraint Composition\\\\\\\"\\\\n    file: section4_composition_draft.tex\\\\n    word_budget: 500  # from 787, -36%\\\\n    action: trim\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      保留所有公式但精简文字：\\\\n      (1) M_final = M_grammar ∧ M_semantic: 保留 eq:composition + 2 句解释\\\\n      (2) Grammar-First Fallback: 压缩为 1 段（保留核心 rule + 1 句 rationale，\\\\n          删除 logit threshold 细节）\\\\n      (3) Constraint Tightness: 保留 eq:tightness + 1 句 intuition + SciERC/DocRED \\\\n          数字对比。删除 Used-for example（读者不需要这个 level 的细节）\\\\n      (4) Decidability Taxonomy: 保留 3-class 列表但每类压缩为 1 句。\\\\n          删除最后段（OntoCoDec 覆盖前两类——读者已知）\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§5 Experiments\\\\\\\"\\\\n    subsections:\\\\n      - subsection: \\\\\\\"§5.1 Setup and Violation Landscape\\\\\\\"\\\\n        file: section3_violation_landscape.tex\\\\n        word_budget: 450  # from 838, -46%\\\\n        action: restructure_and_trim\\\\n        instructions: >\\\\n          原 §3 Violation Landscape 整合为 §5.1，结构重构：\\\\n          (1) 删除独立 section header，改为 \\\\\\\\subsection{Experimental Setup and Violation Landscape}\\\\n          (2) Setup: 2-3 句（models, datasets, metrics 定义）\\\\n          (3) 保留 tab:prompt_comparison（已创建），但删除表格周围的冗余文字描述\\\\n          (4) Violation Distribution: 压缩为 1 段 key findings（DR 15.4% vs 18.7%，\\\\n              tightness drives violations）。Per-relation analysis 压缩为 2 句\\\\n              （Compare 42.4% vs Used-for 0.8% + correlation with tightness）\\\\n          (5) Prompt Insufficiency: 压缩为 1 段（SciERC ↓62% but DocRED only ↓31%；\\\\n              Evaluate-for 反而 +5.8pp → prompt 不可靠）\\\\n          (6) fig:per_relation_dr 保留\\\\n          注意：需要把 \\\\\\\\section{Violation Landscape} 改为 \\\\\\\\subsection，\\\\n          内部 \\\\\\\\subsection 降级为 \\\\\\\\paragraph 或删除\\\\n\\\\n      - subsection: \\\\\\\"§5.2 Results on SciERC\\\\\\\"\\\\n        file: section5_scierc_draft.tex\\\\n        word_budget: 550  # from 742, -26%\\\\n        action: trim\\\\n        instructions: >\\\\n          保留 tab:scierc-ablation + 关键数字，精简分析文字：\\\\n          (1) Main result: DR 15.37%→0.93%（↓94%），ET/RV→0%，F1-neutral\\\\n          (2) Layer decomposition: grammar 消除 RV+ET，semantic+grammar 消除 DR\\\\n          (3) CF analysis: 保留核心发现（CF 9.9% 由 semantic 层引入，grammar CF=0.08%）\\\\n              压缩根因分析为 2 句（EVR pattern + Generic↔OtherScientificTerm）\\\\n          (4) S1 vs S2: 删除详细对比，1 句 \\\\\\\"S2 achieves comparable results (Appendix A)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - subsection: \\\\\\\"§5.3 Cross-Dataset Validation on DocRED\\\\\\\"\\\\n        file: section5_docred_draft.tex\\\\n        word_budget: 600  # from 1450, -59%\\\\n        action: heavy_trim\\\\n        instructions: >\\\\n          这是压缩最大的 experiments 子节。保留核心数字，大砍文字：\\\\n          (1) 保留 tab:docred-ablation（如有），压缩为关键数字段\\\\n          (2) Grammar layer on DocRED: 1 段（RV 29.66%→0.03%，ET 2.48%→0%）\\\\n          (3) Full S1: DR 18.46%→10.21%（↓45%），F1 +0.50pp significant\\\\n          (4) Tightness 对比: DocRED τ̄=0.842 vs SciERC τ̄=0.333 解释 residual DR\\\\n          (5) 删除详细的 per-mode 分析段、DocRED-specific per-relation 分析、\\\\n              与 SciERC 的冗长对比文字。数字让 table 说话\\\\n\\\\n      - subsection: \\\\\\\"§5.4 Cross-Model Validation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        file: section5_crossmodel_draft.tex\\\\n        word_budget: 400  # from 830, -52%\\\\n        action: heavy_trim\\\\n        instructions: >\\\\n          保留 tab:cross-model + 关键发现：\\\\n          (1) Llama-3.1-8B 零代码修改即可使用\\\\n          (2) SciERC: DR 13.3%→0.08%，DocRED: DR 26.07%→2.55%（↓90%）\\\\n          (3) 不同模型的 violation profile 差异（Llama DR更高 but RV更低）\\\\n          (4) 删除详细的 per-metric 讨论、CF 在 Llama 上的详细分析、\\\\n              parse failure 讨论\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§6 Related Work\\\\\\\"\\\\n    file: section6_related_work.tex\\\\n    word_budget: 400  # from 2441, -84%\\\\n    action: rewrite\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      完全重写为 positioning statements，每类工作 2-3 句 + citations：\\\\n      (1) Grammar-constrained decoding: XGrammar/Outlines/LMQL 保证 syntactic validity \\\\n          但不做 semantic constraints [3 citations, 2 句]\\\\n      (2) Semantic constrained decoding (code): Synchromesh/PICARD/MGD/PLDI'25 \\\\n          在代码域做 type checking [4 citations, 2 句]\\\\n      (3) Vocabulary/type-constrained IE: GCD/AdaKGC/GoLLIE/GENRE 做 vocabulary\\\\n          约束但不做 cross-field semantic [4 citations, 2 句]\\\\n      (4) Post-hoc validation: ODKE+/OntoGPT/OntoLogX 检测-修复但不 prevent \\\\n          [3 citations, 2 句]\\\\n      (5) Constrained decoding quality: CRANE/Hidden Cost 担忧质量下降，\\\\n          但 IE 是 extraction 非 reasoning [2 citations, 1 句]\\\\n      (6) OntoCoDec positioning: 1 句总结差异化\\\\n      完整版 Related Work 移入 Appendix B\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"§7 Conclusion\\\\\\\"\\\\n    file: section7_conclusion_compressed.tex  # new merged file\\\\n    word_budget: 500  # from 668+819=1487, -66%\\\\n    action: merge_and_rewrite\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      合并 discussion_paragraphs.tex 关键内容 + section7_conclusion.tex：\\\\n      (1) Contributions summary: 3 句话（violation landscape + framework + empirical 94%）\\\\n      (2) CF severity 精简版（from discussion ¶2）: 3 句——CF 是 per-relation independent \\\\n          enforcement 的系统性副作用，grammar-only CF=0.08% 证实 100% 由 semantic 层引入，\\\\n          dominant pattern Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 反映 type system 歧义\\\\n      (3) F1 significance explanation 精简版（from discussion ¶3）: 2 句——DocRED F1 gain \\\\n          来自 grammar 消除 OOV relations（29.66% RV → 0%），SciERC RV 仅 1.39% 故 F1 \\\\n          effect 不显著\\\\n      (4) Limitations: 3-4 句（CF 9.9% open challenge，2 models，zero-shot only，\\\\n          parse failures on DocRED-Llama）\\\\n      (5) Future work: 2 句（global entity consensus + fine-tuned integration）\\\\n      Low F1 practical significance 和 Post-hoc comparison 移入 Appendix C\\\\n\\\\n  - section: \\\\\\\"Appendix\\\\\\\"\\\\n    files:\\\\n      - appendix_related_work.tex  # full version of §6\\\\n      - appendix_discussion.tex    # moved discussion paragraphs\\\\n      - appendix_s1_vs_s2.tex      # S1 vs S2 details\\\\n      - appendix_prompts.tex       # prompt templates\\\\n    word_budget: unlimited\\\\n    action: create_from_moved_content\\\\n    instructions: >\\\\n      Appendix 结构：\\\\n      A. Full Related Work（当前 section6_related_work.tex 几乎原样保留）\\\\n      B. Extended Discussion（Low F1 practical significance + Post-hoc comparison 原文）\\\\n      C. S1 vs S2 Decoding Strategy Details（tab4_s1_vs_s2 + 分析）\\\\n      D. Prompt Templates（minimal vs schema-informed）\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\n# 表格计划（压缩版）\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\ntable_plan:\\\\n  main_text:\\\\n    - table_id: tab_prompt_comparison\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§5.1\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: created  # 已在 section3_violation_landscape.tex 中\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"prompt comparison across SciERC+DocRED，已有 label tab:prompt_comparison\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - table_id: tab_scierc_ablation\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§5.2\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: exists  # 在 section5_scierc_draft.tex 中\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"5-way ablation (unconstrained/grammar/semantic/full_s1/full_s2)\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - table_id: tab_docred_ablation\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§5.3\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: exists  # 在 section5_docred_draft.tex 中\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"DocRED ablation results\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - table_id: tab_cross_model\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§5.4\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: exists  # 在 section5_crossmodel_draft.tex 中\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"Qwen vs Llama comparison\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  appendix:\\\\n    - table_id: tab_s1_vs_s2\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"Appendix C\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: exists_in_paper_tables_draft\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\n# 图表计划\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\nvisualization_plan:\\\\n  main_text:\\\\n    - fig_id: fig1_overview\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§3 Method\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: generated  # fig1_overview.pdf exists\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"OntoCoDec 架构图。需确认是否已 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\includegraphics\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - fig_id: fig2_per_relation_dr\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"§5.1\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: included  # 已在 section3_violation_landscape.tex 中添加 figure 环境\\\\n      notes: \\\\\\\"Per-relation DR violation rates bar chart\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  appendix:\\\\n    - fig_id: fig3_ablation_layers\\\\n      placement: \\\\\\\"Appendix C\\\\\\\"\\\\n      status: uncertain  # Worker spawned but server restart\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\n# 执行计划（串行，按压缩收益排序）\\\\n# ============================================================================\\\\nexecution_order:\\\\n  - step: 1\\\\n    target: section6_related_work.tex\\\\n    action: rewrite\\\\n    estimated_savings: \\\\\\\"-2 pages\\\\\\\"\\\\n    priority: highest\\\\n    notes: \\\\\\\"2441→400 words。完全重写为 positioning only。原文移入 appendix_related_work.tex\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - step: 2\\\\n    target: \\\\\\\"[section7_conclusion.tex + discussion_paragraphs.tex]\\\\\\\"\\\\n    action: merge_and_rewrite\\\\n    estimated_savings: \\\\\\\"-1.5 pages\\\\\\\"\\\\n    priority: high\\\\n    notes: >\\\\n      1487→500 words。合并为 section7_conclusion_compressed.tex。\\\\n      保留 CF severity + F1 significance 精简版 + contributions + limitations + future work。\\\\n      移出内容到 appendix_discussion.tex。\\\\n\\\\n  - step: 3\\\\n    target: section3_violation_landscape.tex\\\\n    action: restructure_and_trim\\\\n    estimated_savings: \\\\\\\"-1 page\\\\\\\"\\\\n    priority: high\\\\n    notes: >\\\\n      838→450 words。删除 \\\\\\\\section header 改为 \\\\\\\\subsection（main.tex 需同步修改）。\\\\n      §3 改编号后变为 §5.1。保留 tab:prompt_comparison + fig:per_relation_dr。\\\\n\\\\n  - step: 4\\\\n    target