{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KpMAHQM8BjMAjdmJTfGL2N","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# OntoCoDec — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 20:43 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 Llama unconstrained DR 数据错误 (18.36%→26.07%) + 核心方向描述加 model-dependent + 补全近期任务\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n两层约束解码（grammar + semantic）近完全消除 LLM-based IE 的本体类型违规，F1 impact model-dependent: neutral (SciERC) to positive (DocRED Qwen, +0.50pp p<0.001)。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\nResearch — **全部 20 个实验完成**（19 success, 1 killed）。进入论文修订收尾。目标 May 19 内部稿 → May 25 EMNLP ARR。\\\\n\\\\n## 实验完成度\\\\n- 总计: 20 个实验，19 success，1 killed，0 RUNNING\\\\n- SciERC 5-way ablation (Qwen): ✅\\\\n- DocRED 4-way ablation (Qwen): ✅\\\\n- Llama SciERC cross-model: ✅ (DR↓99.4%)\\\\n- Llama DocRED cross-model: ✅ (unconstrained DR=26.07%, full_s1 DR=2.55%, DR↓90.2%)\\\\n- Phase 0 violation landscape: ✅ SciERC + DocRED\\\\n- Post-hoc baseline: ✅ (D013 multi-dimensional framing)\\\\n- Bootstrap CI (D012): ✅ (entity filter bug fixed + re-verified)\\\\n- D011 ET fix (v2 checker): ✅ 全量重跑完成\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策摘要\\\\n- D014: Tightness scaling → 双因素 (tightness × model RV baseline)\\\\n- D013: Post-hoc framing → 不争 F1，多维对比 (recall + coverage + operational)\\\\n- D012: Bootstrap CI → SciERC neutral (p=0.58), DocRED significant (+0.50pp, p<0.001)\\\\n\\\\n## 活跃工作流 (May 14 ~21:30 UTC)\\\\n\\\\n### GPU 实验\\\\n（无 — 全部完成）\\\\n\\\\n### Agent 工作\\\\n- D014 修订指令在队列中等待执行（§5 tightness rewrite + cross-model subsection + abstract/conclusion + limitations + placeholders）\\\\n- 前置 worker callbacks 处理中\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] D014 §5 tightness claim 修订（tightness × RV baseline 双因素）— Agent 队列中\\\\n- [ ] Abstract/Conclusion E-F1 claim limitation（Qwen-specific）— Agent 队列中\\\\n- [ ] §5 Cross-model subsection（2×2 matrix t